    "updated_at": "2017-01-04T21:14:50Z",
    "body": "I think around 10 years ago, there were browsers that only supported `name` (at least in text/html), so that was a more compatible thing to do as an author. I guess the situation is different now, but allowing both is also more less simple to learn.",
