    "created_at": "2017-01-05T09:47:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-05T09:47:32Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think the spec is clear enough that they are different. The remaining question is if we should change the document conformance requirement.\r\n\r\nThere's also the confusion introduced by old versions of XHTML 1.1 making `usemap` an IDREF. See https://ln.hixie.ch/?start=1172653243&count=1\r\n\r\nUsing just `name` avoids that a bit I think.\r\n\r\nIn conclusion I think we should not change this.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
